      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Fuck you niggas talkin' to me about?",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "See, see, as a kid, I felt alienated by the niggas who looked just like me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Niggas treated my nuance like it, like it was a nuisance",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "So, so I was like, I was like, \"Fuck 'em\"",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Fuck 'em, I did my own shit, and now I'm up and now all that paid off",
          "rhyme": "Of",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "And all them niggas, they peaked in high school",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I always had confidence, I ain't never been nervous, I ain't never had anxiety, I ain't never second-guessed myself",
          "rhyme": "Elf",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "If I want it, I go get it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I'm always on go mode, I just go",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I don't know what fear is",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "When they talk about, \"That nigga,\" I'm him, I'm him, I'm that nigga",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "(Run)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "It's funny, right? (Run)",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "For some reason, y'all didn't really think we was gon' be here (Run)",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "See, for y'all, the sky is the limit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "For us, the sky is just what we stand on to reach the beyond (Run, run, run)",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "High above the clouds, as you see us (Gangsta)",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Catch up, niggas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_tyler_baudelaire"
        }
      ],
